<!DOCTYPE html><html lang="fr">
<head>
  <meta charset="UTF-8">
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">  <title>Inscription réussie</title>  <style>
    * {
      box-sizing: border-box;
    }

    body {
      margin: 0;
      padding: 20px;
      min-height: 100vh;
      display: flex;
      align-items: center;
      justify-content: center;
      font-family: Arial, sans-serif;

      /* ARRIÈRE-PLAN */
      background:
        radial-gradient(
          circle at 10% 20%,
          rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.18),
          transparent 25%
        ),
        radial-gradient(
          circle at 90% 80%,
          rgba(255, 215, 100, 0.15),
          transparent 25%
        ),
        linear-gradient(
          135deg,
          #063d2b,
          #08734d,
          #022c20
        );
    }

    .container {
      width: 100%;
      max-width: 430px;
      background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.98);
      padding: 40px 25px;
      border-radius: 18px;
      text-align: center;
      box-shadow: 0 10px 35px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.18);
    }

    .check {
      width: 75px;
      height: 75px;
      margin: 0 auto 20px;
      border-radius: 50%;
      background: #16a34a;
      color: white;
      font-size: 45px;
      display: flex;
      align-items: center;
      justify-content: center;
      font-weight: bold;
    }

    h1 {
      color: #16a34a;
      margin: 0 0 12px;
      font-size: 28px;
    }

    p {
      color: #666;
      line-height: 1.6;
      font-size: 16px;
      margin: 0;
    }

    button {
      width: 100%;
      margin-top: 25px;
      padding: 14px;
      border: none;
      border-radius: 8px;
      background: #16a34a;
      color: white;
      font-size: 16px;
      font-weight: bold;
      cursor: pointer;
    }

    button:active {
      background: #12813b;
    }
  </style></head><body>  <div class="container"><div class="check">✓</div>

<h1>Inscription réussie !</h1>

<p>
  Félicitations !<br>
  Votre inscription a été enregistrée avec succès.
</p>

<button onclick="window.location.href='index.html'">
  Retour à l'inscription
</button>

  </div></body>
</html>